      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BONNIE IS BOUJEE (5) hit the ground running last start and was never headed (25.63) at this track in Mix 5 over 457m. Looks the one to beat. PROFESSOR STARR (2) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (19.14) at Q Straight over 350m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and six minor placings to his credit. Will give a great sight again. MUSCOVITE MICA (4) finds it hard to win. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when third (20.21) at this track. Form here sound including three wins. Winning chance. ULTIMATE ETHICS (1) is worth including after a top-three finish in a tight contest most recently.",
